    "A10, Euclid's axiom", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "c408fc5e-a6e4-4e7a-af2c-ea023e59e0ff"], Cell["\<\
The Euclidean axiom, stated with betweenness and equidistance.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"b2f22c6e-e292-43c8-9de4-beac202fd67c"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"c6887eb7-7da7-4b7a-a3b2-\
